{
  "$schema": "iswc-preview/v1",
  "tag": "iswc-intersection-observer",
  "category": "helpers",
  "title": "&lt;iswc-intersection-observer&gt;",
  "titleHtml": false,
  "styles": [
    ".io-scroller {",
    "      height: 280px;",
    "      overflow: auto;",
    "      border: 1px solid var(--iswc-border);",
    "      border-radius: var(--iswc-radius);",
    "      background: var(--iswc-bg);",
    "      padding: 1rem;",
    "      scroll-behavior: smooth;",
    "    }",
    "    .io-spacer {",
    "      height: 120px;",
    "      display: grid;",
    "      place-items: center;",
    "      color: var(--iswc-text-dim);",
    "      font-size: 0.8rem;",
    "      border: 1px dashed var(--iswc-border-soft);",
    "      border-radius: var(--iswc-radius-sm);",
    "      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;",
    "    }",
    "    .io-card {",
    "      display: flex;",
    "      align-items: center;",
    "      justify-content: space-between;",
    "      gap: 1rem;",
    "      padding: 1rem 1.1rem;",
    "      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;",
    "      border-radius: var(--iswc-radius);",
    "      border: 1px solid var(--iswc-border);",
    "      background: var(--iswc-bg-elev);",
    "      color: var(--iswc-text-soft);",
    "      opacity: 0.45;",
    "      transform: translateY(10px);",
    "      transition: opacity 280ms ease, transform 280ms ease, background 280ms ease, border-color 280ms ease, color 280ms ease;",
    "    }",
    "    .io-card.iswc-in {",
    "      opacity: 1;",
    "      transform: none;",
    "      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--iswc-color-brand) 14%, var(--iswc-bg-elev));",
    "      border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--iswc-color-brand) 45%, var(--iswc-border));",
    "      color: var(--iswc-text);",
    "    }",
    "    .io-card.iswc-in .io-badge {",
    "      background: var(--iswc-brand-soft);",
    "      color: var(--iswc-brand-text);",
    "    }",
    "    .io-badge {",
    "      flex: 0 0 auto;",
    "      font-size: 0.7rem;",
    "      font-weight: 600;",
    "      letter-spacing: 0.04em;",
    "      text-transform: uppercase;",
    "      padding: 0.25em 0.55em;",
    "      border-radius: 999px;",
    "      background: var(--iswc-control-bg);",
    "      color: var(--iswc-text-dim);",
    "    }",
    "    .io-uses {",
    "      display: grid;",
    "      gap: 0.65rem;",
    "      margin: 0;",
    "      padding: 0;",
    "      list-style: none;",
    "    }",
    "    .io-uses li {",
    "      display: grid;",
    "      grid-template-columns: 1.5rem 1fr;",
    "      gap: 0.55rem;",
    "      align-items: start;",
    "      color: var(--iswc-text-soft);",
    "      font-size: 0.92rem;",
    "      line-height: 1.45;",
    "    }",
    "    .io-uses iswc-icon {",
    "      width: 1.15em;",
    "      height: 1.15em;",
    "      color: var(--iswc-accent);",
    "      margin-top: 0.15em;",
    "    }",
    "    .io-diagram {",
    "      display: grid;",
    "      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;",
    "      gap: 0.75rem;",
    "      align-items: center;",
    "      margin: 1rem 0 0;",
    "    }",
    "    .io-diagram__pane {",
    "      border: 1px solid var(--iswc-border);",
    "      border-radius: var(--iswc-radius-sm);",
    "      background: var(--iswc-bg);",
    "      padding: 0.75rem;",
    "      min-height: 7rem;",
    "      position: relative;",
    "    }",
    "    .io-diagram__pane strong {",
    "      display: block;",
    "      font-size: 0.72rem;",
    "      text-transform: uppercase;",
    "      letter-spacing: 0.05em;",
    "      color: var(--iswc-text-dim);",
    "      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;",
    "    }",
    "    .io-diagram__box {",
    "      height: 1.6rem;",
    "      border-radius: 4px;",
    "      margin-bottom: 0.35rem;",
    "      background: var(--iswc-control-bg);",
    "      border: 1px solid var(--iswc-border-soft);",
    "    }",
    "    .io-diagram__box.on {",
    "      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--iswc-color-success) 35%, var(--iswc-control-bg));",
    "      border-color: var(--iswc-color-success);",
    "    }",
    "    .io-diagram__box.off { opacity: 0.35; }",
    "    .io-diagram__viewport {",
    "      outline: 2px dashed var(--iswc-accent);",
    "      outline-offset: -6px;",
    "      border-radius: inherit;",
    "    }",
    "    .io-diagram__arrow {",
    "      color: var(--iswc-text-dim);",
    "      font-size: 1.4rem;",
    "    }",
    "    @media (max-width: 720px) {",
    "      .io-diagram { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }",
    "      .io-diagram__arrow { transform: rotate(90deg); justify-self: center; }",
    "    }"
  ],
  "storageKey": "docs-iswc-intersection-observer",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "Uso",
      "lede": [
        "Responde a una pregunta simple: <strong>¿este elemento está (parcialmente) visible",
        "          dentro de un contenedor?</strong> Si sí, aplica una clase y/o dispara el evento",
        "          <code class=\"code\">iswc-intersect</code>."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "callout",
          "html": [
            "<strong>En la vida real</strong> sirve para revelar animaciones al hacer scroll,",
            "          lazy-load de imágenes/secciones, pausar un video fuera de vista, o marcar el ítem",
            "          activo del índice lateral (como hace este mismo preview)."
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<ul class=\"io-uses\">",
            "          <li>",
            "            <iswc-icon icon=\"mdi:eye-outline\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></iswc-icon>",
            "            <span><strong>No es un timer.</strong> El navegador avisa solo cuando el elemento entra o sale de la zona visible — más barato que escuchar <code class=\"code\">scroll</code>.</span>",
            "          </li>",
            "          <li>",
            "            <iswc-icon icon=\"mdi:vector-intersection\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></iswc-icon>",
            "            <span><strong>Intersección</strong> = overlap entre el hijo observado y el <em>root</em> (viewport o un panel con scroll).</span>",
            "          </li>",
            "          <li>",
            "            <iswc-icon icon=\"mdi:percent-outline\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></iswc-icon>",
            "            <span><strong>threshold</strong> (0–1) = cuánto del elemento debe verse. <code class=\"code\">0.5</code> = al menos la mitad.</span>",
            "          </li>",
            "        </ul>",
            "",
            "        <div class=\"io-diagram\" aria-hidden=\"true\">",
            "          <div class=\"io-diagram__pane\">",
            "            <strong>Página (contenido largo)</strong>",
            "            <div class=\"io-diagram__box off\"></div>",
            "            <div class=\"io-diagram__box on\"></div>",
            "            <div class=\"io-diagram__box on\"></div>",
            "            <div class=\"io-diagram__box off\"></div>",
            "          </div>",
            "          <div class=\"io-diagram__arrow\">→</div>",
            "          <div class=\"io-diagram__pane io-diagram__viewport\">",
            "            <strong>Root / viewport</strong>",
            "            <div class=\"io-diagram__box on\"></div>",
            "            <div class=\"io-diagram__box on\"></div>",
            "            <div style=\"font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--iswc-text-dim);margin-top:0.5rem\">Solo estos disparan “en vista”</div>",
            "          </div>",
            "        </div>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "scroll",
      "title": "Demo: scroll en un panel",
      "lede": [
        "Desplázate <em>dentro</em> del panel. Cada tarjeta arranca atenuada; al entrar",
        "          (≥&nbsp;40&nbsp;% visible) recibe la clase <code class=\"code\">iswc-in</code> y se ilumina.",
        "          El log muestra el evento."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<span class=\"demo-label\">root = #scroller · threshold = 0.4</span>",
            "          <div id=\"scroller\" class=\"io-scroller\">",
            "            <div class=\"io-spacer\">↓ baja para revelar las tarjetas ↓</div>",
            "            <iswc-intersection-observer id=\"ioScroll\" root=\"#scroller\" intersect-class=\"iswc-in\" threshold=\"0.4\">",
            "              <article class=\"io-card\" data-label=\"A\">",
            "                <span>Tarjeta A — fade al entrar</span>",
            "                <span class=\"io-badge\" data-badge>fuera</span>",
            "              </article>",
            "              <article class=\"io-card\" data-label=\"B\">",
            "                <span>Tarjeta B</span>",
            "                <span class=\"io-badge\" data-badge>fuera</span>",
            "              </article>",
            "              <article class=\"io-card\" data-label=\"C\">",
            "                <span>Tarjeta C</span>",
            "                <span class=\"io-badge\" data-badge>fuera</span>",
            "              </article>",
            "              <article class=\"io-card\" data-label=\"D\">",
            "                <span>Tarjeta D</span>",
            "                <span class=\"io-badge\" data-badge>fuera</span>",
            "              </article>",
            "            </iswc-intersection-observer>",
            "            <div class=\"io-spacer\">fin del scroll</div>",
            "          </div>",
            "          <div class=\"log\" id=\"ioLog\" aria-live=\"polite\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">",
            "            <div class=\"row hint\">Los eventos <code class=\"code\">iswc-intersect</code> aparecen aquí al entrar/salir.</div>",
            "          </div>"
          ],
          "controls": [
            {
              "control": "select",
              "prop": "attr:root",
              "label": "root",
              "options": [
                "#scroller",
                "#scrollerOnce"
              ]
            },
            {
              "control": "text",
              "prop": "attr:intersect-class",
              "label": "intersect-class"
            },
            {
              "control": "number",
              "prop": "attr:threshold",
              "label": "threshold",
              "min": 0,
              "max": 100,
              "step": 1
            },
            {
              "control": "boolean",
              "prop": "attr:once",
              "label": "once"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "once",
      "title": "Una sola vez",
      "titleHtml": false,
      "lede": [
        "Con <code class=\"code\">once</code>, tras la primera entrada deja de observar ese hijo.",
        "          Ideal para animaciones de “reveal” que no deben repetirse al subir/bajar."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<span class=\"demo-label\">once · threshold 0.25</span>",
            "          <div id=\"scrollerOnce\" class=\"io-scroller\" style=\"height:200px\">",
            "            <div class=\"io-spacer\">↓ scroll ↓</div>",
            "            <iswc-intersection-observer root=\"#scrollerOnce\" intersect-class=\"iswc-in\" threshold=\"0.25\" once>",
            "              <article class=\"io-card\" data-label=\"once-1\">",
            "                <span>Reveal permanente (no vuelve a “fuera”)</span>",
            "                <span class=\"io-badge\">esperando</span>",
            "              </article>",
            "              <article class=\"io-card\" data-label=\"once-2\">",
            "                <span>Otra animación one-shot</span>",
            "                <span class=\"io-badge\">esperando</span>",
            "              </article>",
            "            </iswc-intersection-observer>",
            "            <div class=\"io-spacer\">fin</div>",
            "          </div>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "reference",
      "title": "Referencia",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "Atributo / evento",
            "Qué hace"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<code>root</code>",
              "Selector del contenedor con scroll. Sin él → viewport de la página."
            ],
            [
              "<code>root-margin</code>",
              "Expande/encoge el área (ej. <code>0px 0px -20% 0px</code>)."
            ],
            [
              "<code>threshold</code>",
              "Fracción visible 0–1 para considerar “intersecta”."
            ],
            [
              "<code>intersect-class</code>",
              "Clase CSS que se pone/quita en el hijo."
            ],
            [
              "<code>once</code>",
              "Tras la 1ª entrada, deja de observar ese hijo."
            ],
            [
              "<code>disabled</code>",
              "Apaga el observer."
            ],
            [
              "<code>iswc-intersect</code>",
              "Evento. <code>detail.entry</code> es el <code>IntersectionObserverEntry</code>."
            ]
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
